<title>UK: Eurofima ups structured bond to 1.0 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Eurofima ups structured bond to 1.0 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured issue has been increased to 1.0 billion French francs from 800 million French francs, lead manager Societe Generale said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT  **1.0 BLN FFR   BASE	 *	   MATURITY    13.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *	   PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.80     FULL FEES   0.325</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.80</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 10-1M     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*5.561 PLUS (4 TIMES DIFFERENCE BETWEEN FFR LIBOR</p>
<p>		 AND DM LIBOR), MIN COUPON ZERO.</p>
<p>	    **ORIGINAL 300 MLN FFR LAUNCHED 13.FEB, INCREASED BY</p>
<p>		500 MLN FFR FEB.20</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
